fix(orchestrator): make per-request SelectionAxes drive model scoring
scale: ~108 lines across 2 files [M]

- `crates/vox-orchestrator/src/models/scoring`: Introduced `AxesOverrideGuard` (RAII) and a `thread_local!` `AXES_OVERRIDE` to allow per-request `AutoRoutingPriority` to be set for model scoring. The `auto_score_model` function was updated to use `base_routing_weights()`, which prioritizes the thread-local override over the environment variable `VOX_AUTO_ROUTING_PRIORITY`.
- `crates/vox-orchestrator/src/models/select`: `select_via_scorer` now uses `AxesOverrideGuard::set` to install the request's `effective_axes` as the scorer's base weights, ensuring that per-task `SelectionAxes` influence model selection. The guard is dropped after scoring.

